/T (The Youth Red Cross \(YRC\) and Red Ribbon Club \(RRC\) organized a Health Awareness Programme on 27 July 2026 for students from all departments. Dr. M. Janaki, Medical Officer, AYUSH Health and Wellness Center \(Homeopathy\), Therkutheru, Madurai, served as the resource person and created awareness about maintaining good health and adopting healthy lifestyle practices. The programme emphasized preventive healthcare and encouraged students to develop healthy and responsible habits. The programme was coordinated by Mr. C. Balaguru, AP/Mech, RRC Coordinator & Mr. R. Rajendran, AP/Civil, YRC Coordinator. )
